            "desc": "India's physical features are diverse and unique, ranging from the lofty Himalayas and fertile Northern Plains to the vast Thar Desert, Peninsular Plateau, Coastal Plains, and Islands. These major physical divisions shape the country's climate, agriculture, biodiversity, and way of life, making India one of the most geographically varied nations in the world."
